  Zone Capacitance Multiplier Research Special fl2_thz0, !- Name
  fl2_thz0,                                       !- Zone or ZoneList Name
  8,                                      !- Temperature Capacity Multiplier
  ,                                       !- Humidity Capacity Multiplier
  ,                                       !- Carbon Dioxide Capacity Multiplier
  ;                                       !- Generic Contaminant Capacity Multiplier

